-Uo8yISnFoayvXZZ-3nKps5fu4-eQUPnQk_bK0mY5qVw&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ord5-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQFd0wMUlc1OhdUFn-IkK7KzAuB615AgH2oohAvik7U76g&oe=6A95B8DB"}, {"file_name": "Screenshots_2560x1440_DD_redlight.png", "id": "885485973918344", "uri": "https://scontent-ord5-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/499307470_885485977251677_236459379275901057_n.png?_nc_cat=101&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=g4HzGmt3khEQ7kNvwFMBkyY&_nc_oc=Adpm4Bpn4Dyf_UrY4hEDcQH999Di-sION0E9rWANLRomHZPKN5kPmJxQyKfFODJmcM4&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ord5-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQHQx6BcpubOgYkoRAYVzb_cLcYHuapSANu4mNXIW-rSbg&oe=6A95CE41"}, {"file_name": "Screenshots_2560x1440_DD_treasurechest.png", "id": "1554385379036074", "uri": "https://scontent-ord5-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/499300619_1554385382369407_6649834865537826538_n.png?_nc_cat=104&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=peyXHyOXmA0Q7kNvwFAnMNc&_nc_oc=AdqNJl8R6dYhNAC9mxcVoz5CooIsPzp3bniDnTNQgR5hEJo9BKXNyfedZNlkvCilWLc&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ord5-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQF0Yw-XzZxpVIAYU-tamjyjB4XtedLUaLX_5_SDzKSCpQ&oe=6A95E271"}, {"file_name": "Screenshots_2560x1440_DD_rouletteGun.png", "id": "861787259535773", "uri": "https://scontent-ord5-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/499304162_861787262869106_4083471127808216396_n.png?_nc_cat=108&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=gInw3RRAGu4Q7kNvwGHBj32&_nc_oc=Adre5a-xuc9_v_D2_F_pjfMRRsEXFXHNGya2r5a6DjsNr7lbAqTAEfSKmMQutO4FttA&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ord5-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQGWnlyAfJMK8K3y65txTBmovuUvdZrwiKNeZZpk6xqZQQ&oe=6A95BBC3"}], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": {"file_name": "CoverLandscape_2560x1440_DD_08_goldmoon.png", "id": "1508503193997973", "uri": "https://scontent-ord5-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/499308307_1508503200664639_4415398320502851739_n.png?_nc_cat=104&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=H_7Dmr0o_qUQ7kNvwEkXrQq&_nc_oc=Adp7xGRywbHPK79SjOJr8PEsysZ5u2dPkpSYG1p9r9uLdFAWLbun0VxIxrwr8NduTXg&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ord5-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQFOb6_8G8B7lUX2kQAsVxw05lTFJ0N6rtpt6nEz3B1gPw&oe=6A95DED6"}, "display_name": "Deadly Delivery", "keywords": ["Multiplayer", "Horror", "Company", "lethal", "coop"], "long_description": "# The Goldmoon Update is OUT NOW!\n\nIn Deadly Delivery, you and your fellow delivery goblins are tasked with delivering parcels into pitch-black mines full of... things. \nArmed with questionable equipment, you'll sneak, sprint, and scream your way through procedurally generated tunnels.\n{9656622597769756}\n\nJoin our discord to be part of the community and find other goblins to play with! discord.gg/vxaFQr9jqC\n\n\n\n# Features\n# \ud83d\udc80 Deadly Co-op Missions\n Team up with up to 3 other players in online co-op. Coordinate, deliver, and survive, or watch your coworkers get picked off one by one.\n{671974505659765}\n\n# \ud83d\udd26 Physics based VR Horror\n Built for VR with a physics based world, spatial audio, and proximity voice chat. \nHaul a variety of parcels, climb on other players or give them a slap of encouragement \n{4124201431128214}\n\n# \ud83d\udc79 Monsters With Personality\n Face off against terrifying entities, some may even look and act like your teammates. Learn their patterns, or feed them your friends.\n\n# \u26f0\ufe0f Progression\nLevel up, upgrade your gear, grab a pet, unlock cosmetics!\n", "short_description": "An online VR co-op horror game about delivering parcels into haunted mines. \nAvoid monsters, drop off packages, and pray you reach the quota! \nTeam up with up to 3 other delivery goblins, survive your shift and pay back your student loans."}]}, "developer_name": "Flat Head Studio", "developer_privacy_policy_url": "https://deadlydelivery.com/privacy-policy.html", "developer_terms_of_service_url": null, "publisher_name": "Flat Head Studio, Creature", "support_website_url": null, "website_url": "https://deadlydelivery.com/", "category": null, "comfort_rating": "COMFORTABLE_FOR_SOME", "comfort_tags": [], "context_category"